<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_数值下降、减弱、平息与冷却 (Decrease, Subsiding & Calming — '走低/平息')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 138 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 1/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下去，下沉，坠落</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>descend, travel</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move downward and lower, but not necessarily all the way<div class='ex-sent'>“The temperature is going down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下来，下跌，落泊</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>descend, travel</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move downward and lower, but not necessarily all the way<div class='ex-sent'>“The temperature is going down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>have <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>知道，了解，认识</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>know, mastered</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> have (something) mastered<div class='ex-sent'>“She has the names of the fifty states down pat”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 1/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下来，吞下，写下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>lower</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> lower (one's body) as by kneeling<div class='ex-sent'>“Get down on your knees!”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 2/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下去，下沉，坠落</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>sink, settle</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go under,<div class='ex-sent'>“The raft sank and its occupants drowned”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 3/6</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下来，吞下，写下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>unhorse, dismount</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> alight from (a horse)<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to get down (alight from (a horse)).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 4/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>开始，出发，启动</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>begin, start</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take the first step or steps in carrying out an action<div class='ex-sent'>“We began working at dawn”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 5/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下来，吞下，写下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>write, down</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put down in writing; of texts, musical compositions, etc.<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to get down (put down in writing).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>义项 6/6</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使沮丧</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>depress, deject</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> lower someone's spirits; make downhearted<div class='ex-sent'>“These news depressed her”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 3/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>坠落，下降</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>decline, wane</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> grow smaller<div class='ex-sent'>“Interest in the project waned”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 4/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>a. 记录的，记得，牢记</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recorded</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be recorded or remembered<div class='ex-sent'>“She will go down as the first feminist”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 5/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下去，下沉，传下去</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>lose, defeated</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be defeated<div class='ex-sent'>“If America goes down, the free world will go down, too”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 6/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>下去，下沉，咽下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>ingested</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be ingested<div class='ex-sent'>“This wine sure goes down well”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 7 个核心义项'>义项 7/7</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>坠落，平静下来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>crash, fail</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> stop operating<div class='ex-sent'>“My computer crashed last night”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>down on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>口交</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>fellate, suck</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> provide sexual gratification through oral stimulation<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to go down on (provide sexual gratification through oral stimulation).”</div></td></tr>
