<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>slim <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>减少，分解，降低</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reduce, slim</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take off weight<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to slim down (take off weight).”</div></td></tr>
