<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>weigh <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使负重，使下沉</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>sadden, disheartening</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be oppressive or disheartening to<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to weigh down (be oppressive or disheartening to).”</div></td></tr>
