<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>melt <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>熔化</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>melt, dissolve</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> reduce or cause to be reduced from a solid to a liquid state, usually by heating<div class='ex-sent'>“melt butter”</div></td></tr>
