<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>slick <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使平，捋平，使平静</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>slick, comb</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> give a smooth and glossy appearance<div class='ex-sent'>“slick one's hair”</div></td></tr>
