<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>rattle <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>背诵，朗读，叙述</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>recite</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> recite volubly or extravagantly<div class='ex-sent'>“He could recite the names of all the chemical elements”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>bog <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>陷入困境</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>mire, further</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> be unable to move further<div class='ex-sent'>“The car bogged down in the sand”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>sleek <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使光滑，使漂亮，梳头发</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>slick, comb</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> give a smooth and glossy appearance<div class='ex-sent'>“slick one's hair”</div></td></tr>
