<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>tramp <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>踏坏</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trample, walk</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> walk on and flatten<div class='ex-sent'>“tramp down the grass”</div></td></tr>
