<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_压制、击败、拒绝与贬低羞辱 (Suppression, Defeat, Rejection & Criticism — '压服/驳回')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 54 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拒绝</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>refuse, reject</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> refuse to accept<div class='ex-sent'>“He refused my offer of hospitality”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>调低，关小（音量/灯光/热度）</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>diminish, lower</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make lower or quieter<div class='ex-sent'>“turn down the volume of a radio”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 3/4</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使更坏，使恶化，使降低</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>worsen, decline</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> take a downward direction<div class='ex-sent'>“The economy finally turned down after a long boom”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 4/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拒绝，驳回（请求/提议）</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>reject, decline</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> reject with contempt<div class='ex-sent'>“She spurned his advances”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>back <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>取消前言</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>withdraw, retreat</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move backwards from a certain position<div class='ex-sent'>“The bully had to back down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>let <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>减速下降</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>lower, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move something or somebody to a lower position<div class='ex-sent'>“take down the vase from the shelf”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>put <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 8 个核心义项'>义项 1/8</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放下，记下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>place, pose</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to sit or seat or be in a settled position or place<div class='ex-sent'>“set down your bags here”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>back <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>取消前言</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>retire, withdraw</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> remove oneself from an obligation<div class='ex-sent'>“He bowed out when he heard how much work was involved”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>down on</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>轻视，看不起</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>contemn, despise</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> regard with contempt<div class='ex-sent'>“the new neighbor looks down on us because our house is very modest”</div></td></tr>
