<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04_写下记录、传代与定居专心 (Recording, Inheritance & Settling — '落笔/安顿')</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 23 个独立义项 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='23%'>Phrasal Verb & 可拆分性</th><th width='21%'>🎯 该义项专属中文释义</th><th width='18%'>🔄 对应单字替代动词</th><th width='38%'>特定英文定义 & 语境例句</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 1/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>降低，跌落，减弱</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>lower, displace</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> move something or somebody to a lower position<div class='ex-sent'>“take down the vase from the shelf”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 2/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>记下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>note, written</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make a written note of<div class='ex-sent'>“she noted everything the teacher said that morning”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>义项 3/4</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>拿下，记下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>level, raze</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> tear down so as to make flat with the ground<div class='ex-sent'>“The building was levelled”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable'><td class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>lying down</span><div><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>甘受</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>digest, endure</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> suffer without protest; suffer or endure passively<div class='ex-sent'>“I won't take this insult lying down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 1/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放下，使下车，记下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>write, down</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put down in writing; of texts, musical compositions, etc.<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to set down (put down in writing).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 2/5</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放下，使下车，记下</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>place, pose</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> cause to sit or seat or be in a settled position or place<div class='ex-sent'>“set down your bags here”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 3/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使着陆，登记</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>land, arrive</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> reach or come to rest<div class='ex-sent'>“The bird landed on the highest branch”</div></td></tr>
