<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>set <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>义项 5/5</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>放下，使下车，使着陆</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>disembark, debark</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> go ashore<div class='ex-sent'>“The passengers disembarked at Southampton”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>hand <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>把...往下递，传下来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>passed</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> passed on, as by inheritance<div class='ex-sent'>“This ring was handed down through many generations”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>write <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>写下，写文章贬低</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>write, down</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> put down in writing; of texts, musical compositions, etc.<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to write down (put down in writing).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>lay <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>建立，确立，制定</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>establish, create</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> institute, enact, or establish<div class='ex-sent'>“make laws”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>camp <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>露营，扎营，投</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>camp, pitch</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> establish or set up a camp<div class='ex-sent'>“They decided to camp down (establish or set up a camp).”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>tie <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 1/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>束缚</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>oblige, bind</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> restrain from independence by an obligation<div class='ex-sent'>“He was tied down by his work”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>tie <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>束缚</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bind, truss</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> secure with or as if with ropes<div class='ex-sent'>“tie down the prisoners”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pin <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使明确说明</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>narrow, specify</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> define clearly<div class='ex-sent'>“I cannot narrow down the rules for this game”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive'><td class='word'>steady <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><div><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物/不拆分 (Intransitive)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>un. 使…改邪归正，安顿下来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>settle, root</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> become settled or established and stable in one's residence or life style<div class='ex-sent'>“He finally settled down”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>nail <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 1/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>用钉钉住</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>nail, peg</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> succeed in obtaining a position<div class='ex-sent'>“He nailed down a spot at Harvard”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pin <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>附上，使依附，使附属</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>attach</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> attach with or as if with a pin<div class='ex-sent'>“pin up a picture”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>pin <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使受约束，把...别住，压制</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>trap, confine</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> place in a confining or embarrassing position<div class='ex-sent'>“He was trapped in a difficult situation”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>nail <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 2/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>使结束，定稿，把最后定下来</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>finalize, finalise</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> make final; put the last touches on; put into final form<div class='ex-sent'>“let's finalize the proposal”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>nail <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>义项 3/3</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>明确</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>narrow, specify</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> define clearly<div class='ex-sent'>“I cannot narrow down the rules for this game”</div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable'><td class='word'>peg <span class='pt-highlight'>down</span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>义项 2/2</span><div><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise'>变窄，详列，指定</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>narrow, specify</span></td><td class='def-en'><b>Meaning:</b> define clearly<div class='ex-sent'>“I cannot narrow down the rules for this game”</div></td></tr>
